he other pair or a single. Starting with a single like ♥4 is too weak and gives initiative away; playing BlackJoker now would be wasteful. My hand has no bombs or rockets, so I must manage my high cards carefully. The pair of 8s gives me the best chance to maintain control and progress toward emptying my hand.  \n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥8", "♣8"]}'}
